  <style:master-page style:name="Landscape" style:page-layout-name="pm2"/>
 </office:master-styles>
 <office:body>
  <office:text>
   <text:tracked-changes>
    <text:changed-region text:id="ct1"><text:insertion><office:change-info><dc:creator>김민지</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-20T10:00:00</dc:date></office:change-info></text:insertion></text:changed-region>
   </text:tracked-changes>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">3분기 영업 보고</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">매출은 전년 대비 <text:span text:style-name="T2">12%</text:span> 증가했다.<text:note text:id="ftn1" text:note-class="footnote"><text:note-citation>1</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p text:style-name="Standard">내부 집계 기준.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note> 신규 고객은 <text:bookmark-start text:name="신규고객"/>34곳<text:bookmark-end text:name="신규고객"/>이며, 그중 <text:span text:style-name="T1">21곳이 수도권</text:span>이다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Note">신규 고객 34곳 중 21곳이 수도권.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><office:annotation><dc:creator>박서준</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-21T09:30:00</dc:date><text:p>지방 수치 재확인 필요</text:p></office:annotation>지방 지점의 매출은 1,204억 원으로 <text:span text:style-name="T3">15% 성장</text:span>했다.<office:annotation-end/></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2">지역별 현황</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">아래 표는 지점별 매출을 정리한 것이다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><draw:frame draw:name="조직도" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="4cm" svg:height="2cm"><draw:image><office:binary-data>iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABAAAAAICAIAAAB/FOjAAAAAE0lEQVR4nGPQiFpAEmIY1UALDQDP+pEBhst/TQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==</office:binary-data></draw:image><svg:title>조직도, 상자 5개</svg:title></draw:frame></text:p>
   <table:table table:name="매출표" table:style-name="Tbl">
    <table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>지역</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>지점</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>매출</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-rows-spanned="2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>서울</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>강남</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>120</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>종로</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>95</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>합계</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>215</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">강남 지점은 <text:span text:style-name="T4">전년 대비</text:span> <text:change-start text:change-id="ct1"/>8% <text:change-end text:change-id="ct1"/>성장했다.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2">향후 계획</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">4분기에는 <text:span text:style-name="T1">부산</text:span>과 <text:span text:style-name="T1">대구</text:span>에 지점을 연다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Quotations">“고객이 있는 곳에 지점이 있어야 한다.” — 영업본부장</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9">부록: 지점 목록</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">서울 강남, 서울 종로, 경기 분당, 인천 송도.</text:p>
  </office:text>
 </office:body>
